WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:16.528
To subscribe, open the Companion tab in the app and tap Subscribe. Choose Monthly or Annual and pay. Then get your code. On the welcome page, enter the email you subscribed with and tap Get code.

00:17.228 --> 00:21.836
Your 6-digit code appears. It lasts 1 hour.

00:22.538 --> 00:28.178
In the app, open Settings, enter the code, and tap Connect my companion.

00:28.878 --> 00:30.990
Your Companion is connected.

00:31.688 --> 00:41.288
If you lose your code, or it expires, just get a new one the same way. Enter your email on the welcome page and tap Get code again.
